     A**  THIS FILE MUST BE ACCESSIBLE BY DEFAULT LIBL (PART OF SYSLIBL OR
     A**     DEFAULT JOBD LIBL)
     A** THIS FILE CONTAINS ONE RECORD PER USER THAT STARTS DTMWORD
     A***  THE LATEST JOB THAT STARTED WILL BE UPDATED WITH THE IP ADDRESS
     A***   USERS SHOULD NOT BE ON TWO SESSIONS AT SAME TIME, ELSE IT WONT WORK
     A***
     A**** THIS FILE IS CREATED ON ASDP03 IN QGPL AS WELL AS EACH CLIENT LIB.
     A*** THIS IS BECAUSE OTHER LOGINS (SIS) WILL ACCESS THE SYSTEM AND THE IBM
     A***  EXIT POINT DOES NOT KNOW IT'S NOT A PDS USER.  IF THE FILE WAS NOT
     A***  FOUND AN ERROR WOULD OCCUR, SO CRTDUPOBJ IS PERFORMED TO DUPLICATE
     A***  SAIPP INTO QGPL FOR COMPATIBILITY ONLY.
     ********  ANY UPDATES MUST BE RE DUPED INTO QGPL (DLT AND REDUP)
     ***
     ***
     A**
     A          R PIP01                     TEXT('IP ADDRESS FILE FOR DTMWORD')
     A            IPJOB         10          COLHDG('JOBNAME S/B QZRCSRVS')
     A            IPJOBN         6          COLHDG('JOBNUMBER')
     A            IPJUSR        10          COLHDG('JOB USR FOR JOB')
     A            IPIPAD        15          COLHDG('IP ADDR DTMWORD')
     A            IPRUSR        10          COLHDG('REAL USR FOR JOB')
     A            IPDT           7S 0       COLHDG('LAST MAINT DT')
     A            IPTM           6S 0       COLHDG('LAST MAINT TM')
     A*
     A          K IPRUSR
     A*
